### Health
GET http://localhost:5000/health

### Generate a grounded answer
POST http://localhost:5000/api/ai/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "What is self-attention?",
  "conversationId": "demo",
  "context": "Retrieved passages from the indexed research papers go here."
}

### Read saved history
GET http://localhost:5000/api/ai/history?conversationId=demo&limit=20
